@title playing with the weather

Two things that can only be done outdoors, and never while in the
water. The verbs are not translated yet:

  hacer bola de nieve
  hacer muñeco de nieve

They need snow falling where you are. Only one snowman fits in a
place, and it stands for a while before another can be made.

  mojar <somebody>

Needs rain, or puddles. The other person has to be where you are.
